1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,260
Five more things you must never do in India, the destination of the year.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:10,144
Don't keep your shoes on at a temple. Take them off, and ask before you take photos.

3
00:00:10,964 --> 00:00:17,840
Don't drink in public. It's illegal in parks and other public places, and some states ban alcohol completely.

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:24,337
Don't show affection in public. India is conservative, and it can draw negative attention.

5
00:00:25,157 --> 00:00:32,118
Don't buy ivory or wildlife products. Trading protected animals or their parts without a licence can mean prison.

6
00:00:32,937 --> 00:00:40,784
And don't go near North Sentinel Island. It's illegal within five nautical miles, and an American was arrested there in twenty twenty-five.

